.SH EDITING
.PP
Pressing \fIe\fR or \fIEnter\fR on a file opens your editor at the exact line
corresponding to the cursor position in the diff.\& The editor is
determined by, in order:
.PP
.PD 0
.IP 1. 4
\fIDIFI_EDITOR\fR environment variable
.IP 2. 4
\fIEDITOR\fR environment variable
.IP 3. 4
\fIVISUAL\fR environment variable
.IP 4. 4
\fIvi\fR (fallback)
.PD
.PP
.SH CONFIGURATION
.PP
\fBdifi\fR reads its configuration from \fI\(ti/.\&config/difi/config.\&yaml\fR.\& If the
file does not exist, sensible defaults are used.\&
.PP
