.SH FILES
.PP
\fI\(ti/.\&config/difi/config.\&yaml\fR
.RS 4
User configuration file.\&
.PP
.RE
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.PP
\fIDIFI_EDITOR\fR
.RS 4
Preferred editor (highest priority).\&
.PP
.RE
\fIEDITOR\fR, \fIVISUAL\fR
.RS 4
Fallback editor, checked in order after \fIDIFI_EDITOR\fR.\&
.PP
.RE
.SH INTEGRATIONS
.PP
.SS Git alias
.PP
To use \fBdifi\fR as a native git command:
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
git config --global alias\&.difi \&'!difi\&'
.fi
.RE
.PP
Then run \fIgit difi\fR directly from any repository.\&
.PP
.SS vim-fugitive
.PP
\fBdifi\fR integrates with vim-fugitive for a side-by-side diff editing
experience.\& See the project README for configuration details.\&
.PP
.SS difi.nvim
.PP
The companion Neovim plugin \fBdifi.\&nvim\fR provides auto-open, inline
visual diffs, and interactive review.\& See
\fIhttps://github.\&com/xguot/difi.\&nvim\fR.\&
.PP
